@copilot Update this PR directly to address the valid Copilot review finding https://github.com/open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation/pull/20924#discussion_r4365057362. Remove all changes to docs/instrumentation-list.yaml from this PR, restoring that generated file to the PR's base version. The repository instruction .github/instructions/instrumentation-list.instructions.md explicitly reserves it for the nightly .github/workflows/metadata-update.yml workflow. This corrects the earlier assignment's request to include generated catalog updates.

Preserve every other delivered change: all seven exact production metric description/unit fixes, the database backticks, legacy RPC milliseconds, current RPC seconds, the new focused GenAI test, and all directly related assertions. Do not regenerate or hand-edit the catalog, change metric behavior, alter unrelated files, create another PR, or edit the PR title or description. The coordinator handles review replies and metadata.

Acceptance criteria: this PR has no diff for docs/instrumentation-list.yaml, and all existing production and test changes remain intact. Verify that the correction is limited to the generated-file revert; no build or CI wait is needed for this documentation-only follow-up.
